WEBVTT

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.630
Okay!
Nice!

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.210
Go ahead!
Over here!

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.330
Okay!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.250
Go ahead!

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.460
All right! That's it for today!

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.170
Start cleaning up, please!

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:12.330
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.290
You sure she's meeting up
with the guy in question today?

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.500
She's been coming home late
two or three days a week for a while now.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.000
And this morning, she said
that she'd be home late again, so...

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.170
I'm sure.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.960
Listen up. The first thing
is to find out about the guy in question.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.130
You follow her and catch them meeting up together.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.500
I'm kinda getting nervous!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.540
Since we'll be getting home late, too...

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.290
I bought these.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.040
Anpan and milk.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.790
Are we playing stakeout?

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.460
Hey! She's on the move!

00:00:58.580 --> 00:00:59.580
Let's follow her!

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.630
Okay!

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.210
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.210
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.370
Utsukushiku are

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.370
Be beautiful

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:26.330
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:26.330
No Destiny, unworthy

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.290
Konnanja kitto monotarinai

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.290
If it's like this, then probably things will go well

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.420
You okay...?

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.420
Did something happen...?

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.420
I'll...

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.420
Be waiting for you...

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.120
Kurai katattokeba umaku iku

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.120
If we just talk as if it's never enough

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.370
Mono, kane, ai, koto,

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.370
Things, money, love, words,

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.120
Mou jikokenji akita

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.120
I'm tired of self-asserting myself already

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.250
I got here before you.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.250
I have the correct meeting place, right?

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.250
Did something happen? You okay?

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:41.330
Déjà vu nani ga sonna fuman nanda?

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:41.330
Déjà vu, what are you so unsatisfied about?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.080
Sanzan wagamama katattoite

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.080
You've said all sorts of selfish things,

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.000
Kore ijou hoka ni nani ga iru?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.000
what more could you possibly want?

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.790
Sonna tokoro mo warito kirai ja nai

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.790
I kind of don't mind that about you

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.420
Mou "kiki akitanda yo sono serifu"

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.420
Honestly, "I'm sick of hearing that line"

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.210
Chuuto hanpa dake ha iya

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.210
The one thing I don't want is ambiguousness

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.960
Mou ii aa shite kou shite ittetatte

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.960
Enough. Even if you say to do this or that,

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.830
Aishite doushite? iwaretatte

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.830
Even if you say love me, or why?

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.620
Asobi dakenara kantan de

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.620
It's easy if it's just for fun

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.420
Shinken koushou muchakucha de

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.420
And that it's reckless serious negotiating

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.750
Omoi mo shinai omoi kotoba

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.750
How many times are those worn out unexpectedly

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.830
Nando tsukai furusu noka?

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.830
Serious words going to be used?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.920
Douse kitai shitetanda deki race demo

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.920
We were hoping anyway, even if it was a fixed race,

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.540
Inyou darake no phrase mo

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.540
Even all those quoted phrases,

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:23.170
Kakato mochiagaru kotoba taboo ni shite

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:23.170
Making backtracking words taboo

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:27.290
Kuuki wo yonda ame furanaide yo

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:27.290
Take a hint, don't let it rain

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:30.080
Domestic Girlfriend

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.100
CHEAP

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.100
DELICIOUS

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.100
STANDING BAR KODANUKI

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.170
Welcome!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.380
ALCOHOL

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.960
A standing bar?

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.130
She's probably meeting up with him inside.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.790
But she's already drinking by herself.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.420
Maybe the guy's going to be late.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.170
Exactly what kind of guy is she with...?

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.580
Hey! Hey, wake up!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:16.710
Did he come?

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:17.580
Nope...

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.790
In the end, she's been drinking by herself for four hours.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.250
Hina-chan, you should probably stop now!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.500
Four hours drinking at a standing bar...

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.580
At this point, it doesn't look like
they're gonna have a tryst today.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.920
Come to think of it...

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.580
The other day...

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.960
when I went into Hina-nee's room...

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.830
"SH"

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:42.170
That's it! That's probably
the "Sh" for "Shuu"! The guy's name!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.000
Yeah!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.630
So, it's tomorrow...

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.000
Give me a break!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:46.750
Aww!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.580
She's really in a hurry today...

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.830
Just as we thought, they must be meeting up today then.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.540
It looks like she went into a store down below.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.250
Damn! It's kinda hard to follow her.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.540
Hey. Here.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.710
Live Comedy

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.710
Moripro

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.710
Young Artists

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.710
Laughs

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.330
The "Sh" stood for "Showtime"...?

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.130
That was really funny!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.670
Thank you!

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:23.130
We hope you come to the next one.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:26.790
She came out like she'd enjoyed the show as usual...

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.630
I'll attend again! Please keep up the good work!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.630
Looks like she's just heading home now.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:53.670
She's totally having a quiet laugh
over what she just saw...

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.630
I see.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.380
So, these last few days have been duds.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:05.000
All we learned is how much Sensei likes her alone time.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.880
At that rate, she'd probably be willing
to eat yakiniku by herself.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.210
But I think there's no doubt about today.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.670
She has that kinda restless look,
and she keeps checking the time...

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.920
Oh! Here! Over here!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.040
Is he here?!

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:21.170
The one she's having an affair with...

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.170
...is a girl?!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.330
Why meet outside of school...?

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.080
How was it?

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.130
Based on the little eavesdropping I did,
she appears to be a student of hers.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:38.000
She was giving her advice about her future plans.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:44.210
Given all we've seen, I just get the feeling
that she's your typical good teacher, but...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.790
I wonder why she's even having an affair then?

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.540
All right... at this point, we have no choice.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.460
It's the last resort...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.920
Were you able to bring it without being caught?

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.790
Yeah.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.710
That's good...

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.580
Can you unlock it?

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.830
If I remember correctly, she has it set to her date of birth.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.830
There it is!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.000
H

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.000
Highball

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.000
Hagiwara Shuu

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.000
Haneda Ryoko

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.000
Hiyoshiya

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.040
All right!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:46.750
You got this? Try to mimic Sensei's voice
as closely as possible.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.040
Yeah...!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.880
Make sure you clearly talk of breaking up!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:05.580
Hello.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.710
Uh... Er, um...

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.250
Hina-chan?

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.040
Uh... Um... It's...

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:17.630
Hey!

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.250
Wh-when I heard his voice...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.000
Contacts

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.000
Edit

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.000
Shuu Hagiwara

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.880
m-my mind went blank...

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.710
Crap...

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.830
I forgot that she has communication issues...

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.630
I-I have to decide on what I'm going to say...

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:33.460
Shuu Hagiwara

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:34.370
Shuu Hagiwara

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:34.370
Incoming call...

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.210
Whoa!

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.250
Wh-wh-what do I do?!

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.880
A-answer it! Say that you want to break up!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.710
Y-yes? Hello...

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:46.580
You okay?

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.290
Did something happen?

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:54.330
What?! Something...? Uh, that is...

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.830
It... It's nothing!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.670
You can't do it.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.040
Yeah...

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.800
CAFÉ

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.800
L'AMANT

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.790
And so...

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.580
We sunk, Captain...

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:11.460
Sorry...

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:16.420
Oh no, it was also our fault for asking you
to do the impossible and talk like Sensei.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.500
So, it's back to square one, huh?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.710
What's up?

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:23.330
What's going on? You all look gloomy.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.290
Actually...

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:30.080
Someone close to him is having an affair right now,
and we're trying to get them to break up.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:37.540
For real?! I love that kind of stuff! Tell me all the details.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.960
This is no laughing matter, Kobayashi-san!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.250
MARIE! I've told you to call me Marie!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.790
We're seriously struggling over this...

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.130
Do you have any good ideas?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.960
How should I know about stuff like that?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.210
But, how nice it is to be young.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.750
You guys look so radiant to me.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.920
Welcome!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.420
Rui... Natsuo-kun...

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.420
Students from your school?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.130
Sh-she's my younger sister,
and he's now my younger brother.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.380
We became family after my mom's remarriage...

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.710
H..Hina-nee.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.250
Please...! Break up with Sensei!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:45.960
Whoa!

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.790
N..Natsuo-kun...

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.540
You're married, aren't you?!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.750
H-hey...

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.670
If you're aware that you're doing something wrong,
then please break up with her right now!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:03.580
Don't do such an irresponsible thing
and make Sensei miserable!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.080
You may be having fun, but...!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.960
Calm down.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.420
Violence is not allowed in this establishment.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.880
It appears that...

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.210
the circumstances seem inevitable.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.830
Here you go!

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:31.420
This is L'Amant's specialty,
Napolitan with whole sausages!

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:36.500
This is on me. After all, it's easy to get irritable
when one is hungry.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.420
Now then, go debate to your heart's content. Fight on!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:44.500
Wow! You can feel that electrifying tension
just pulsate through you!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.330
Why are you getting so excited?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.500
You two...

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.210
You can't be like that.
You know it's serious for the parties involved.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:53.630
Hmm?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:54.420
Oh!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.040
Gah!
Oh!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:01.220
NOW!!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:01.220
A CAFÉ WHERE YOU CAN WATCH

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:01.220
CAUGHT-IN-THE-ACT PANDEMONIUM!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:01.220
L'AMANT

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:59.750
Instead of just us enjoying it,
we have to turn this into a chance for business!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:00.750
Stop that!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:02.420
I'm gonna post it in front of the train station!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.000
Um...
I'm gonna post it in front of the train station!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:03.710
Um...
Good idea!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:04.790
Where should I begin...?
That's a "No"!

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.920
Where should I begin...?
L'Amant, the "caught-in-the-act" café!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:06.670
L'Amant, the "caught-in-the-act" café!

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:09.290
It's hard to broach the subject
with so much pressure, but...

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.580
Come on, you two...

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.460
It's fine.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:15.170
I should begin by introducing myself.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:20.040
My name is Shuu Hagiwara.
I'm 32 years old. Married with no children.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:24.000
I have had the pleasure of dating Hina-san
for the past two years.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:26.080
I am currently working as a biology researcher at a university lab.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.130
From before I met Sensei...
I am currently working as a biology researcher at a university lab.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.040
Which of you?

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.880
Which of you initiated asking the other out?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.710
Depending on that,
things can change about who's at fault.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.580
"Who's at fault," huh...?

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.580
We never officially said "Let's go out!" to each other,

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.630
but I'm the one who initiated things, so that would be me.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:56.170
If that caused you to worry, I apologize.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.170
Sensei... You know, that's...

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.080
an expression I've never seen before...

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.290
I'd heard a little bit about the fact
that she'd moved and that her family had grown.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:12.630
To be honest, I wanted to do proper introductions
instead of being found out this way.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:13.920
Huh?!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.880
Do you not understand the position you're in?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.710
Do you get that what you're doing
is having an affair? An affair!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.710
Don't you have a wife at home?!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.580
You've gotta be nuts to turn a blind eye to that

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.170
and want to introduce yourself to the family

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:27.880
of the person you're having an affair with!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.710
That's being rude to your wife and to Sensei!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.380
Don't you, like, even feel sorry at all?!

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.210
I do feel that.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:42.960
But I still like Hina-chan.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.630
I don't think of this as a "fling"...

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.580
It's the "real thing" to me.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.880
It's Natsuo-kun, right?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.210
You're feeling indignation because I'm married, right?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.670
In that case...

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.250
If I got divorced, would you give us your blessing?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.210
As if I could trust you...

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:09.920
The kind of person who still continues
to make Sensei cry...

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:12.330
I don't think you could make her happy.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:12.880
What?
Natsuo-kun...

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.580
Natsuo-kun...

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:14.920
You've been crying...?

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:22.920
I'm sorry...

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.880
that you were suffering that much pain...

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.830
But, I told you before, didn't I?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.830
I also want to throw it all away
and be with you, Hina-chan, but...

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.830
in reality, it just doesn't work that way.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.040
I need a little more time.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:40.960
And then-

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:41.710
Cut the crap-!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.250
H-hey!

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.000
Th-there it is!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.500
The so-called "Water Splash"!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.130
How moving!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.920
Wow! It really did turn into pandemonium...

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.580
I'll go clean up!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.330
I didn't think Rui-chan would do that...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.630
I suspect for that guy, he knew to expect that.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.960
Well, the fact that Rui-Rui flipped out first

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.250
might have been a miscalculation on his part but...

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:46.330
H-hey... just how long are you gonna run for?!
I understand how you feel, but...

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.710
I didn't particularly ask you to follow me.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:54.750
If you hadn't done that, then I probably would have.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.290
Well, maybe it was better that you did it.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.960
If it had been me, I probably would've punched him.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.540
There was that option.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.920
Then, you wanna go together to beat him up now?

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.460
If it's outside the store, then we won't
be causing trouble for anyone.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.580
Feel free to go by yourself.
Punch him enough for me, too.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:15.330
Whoa... You're totally pulling the rug out from under me...

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.540
I don't ever want to see a jerk like that's face again!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.710
Frustrated...

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.170
I'm so frustrated...!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.330
I'm sorry... about my little sister...

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:58.420
It's fine. They replaced
the Napolitan anyway. It was good.

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.790
You know, when they're around that age,
kids have a particularly strong sense of justice.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:11.790
I can understand why they would
assert the idea of "This is how it should be."

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:17.960
Also, besides them being against this,
I did find out one other thing.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:18.830
What?

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.830
Natsuo-kun is in love with you, Hina-chan, isn't he?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.630
And... what about you?

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.790
What about me?

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.210
About Natsuo-kun.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.880
Come on...

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.040
He's just a kid, you know?

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:37.330
Yeah? It doesn't look like you really think of him that way.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:41.540
Please stop with the weird suspicions.
They're both precious family to me.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:46.000
Sorry, sorry. It was just a joke.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:55.330
After seeing that precious family today,
I've come to a decision.

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:58.630
I think we need some space
apart from each other at this point.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.000
I can't put those two in any more-

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.460
Hey, Shuu-!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.290
What about you personally?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.290
Not what others around you think...

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.290
What are YOUR feelings...?

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.080
Whoa!

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:41.210
Oh... it's you. You startled me!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:43.630
What? You've got frizzy hair, too?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.670
Well, yeah, but not as bad as you.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.630
Actually...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.710
yours rivals mine.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.830
Hey.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.630
Take a quick look. Are my eyes still puffy?

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.670
Uh, a little.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:58.750
So... you okay?

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.330
Yeah...

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.920
Now that's rather conspicuous...

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:12.040
Everyone's been coming home late recently,
so I thought you guys might've forgotten.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:16.000
Crap. I've been running around so much
that I totally forgot.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.250
Shall we order something like sushi tonight?

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:22.880
Wow! That's a huge flower mark!

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:24.880
Fujii-san, did you draw that?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.330
Yep. Did you remember?

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:31.710
Of course! The two of us have shopped
for a present together every year. Right, Rui?

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.750
You really don't have to go out of your way to, okay?

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:37.580
What? We haven't gone out of our way at all.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.580
Thanks for the meal.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:40.630
Rui.

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.000
What do you want to do about this year's present...?

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:50.040
Natsuo-kun, if you'd like to,
want to go shopping together today?

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.790
Oh, um...

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.750
I'm sorry. I sort of can't today...

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.880
I will have a present ready, though.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.630
Are you going today?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.380
Yeah.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:05.380
Then can you send my regards too? I'll go next week, so.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.540
All right.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.710
"Going," as in where?

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.130
Hmm? Ah...

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.540
He goes to visit every year, on this day.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:25.580
Oh!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.880
So, he was here after all.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.750
Hi, Dear. Welcome back.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.880
Crying again, Natsuo?

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.830
He says that he can't catch anyone playing tag.

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:42.080
Even though he's become a first-year in elementary,
Natsuo hasn't stopped being a crybaby.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.420
Oh, that reminds me! I thought for Natsuo's sake...

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.080
I ordered lots of stuff online!

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:54.250
I wonder if being a crybaby
can be fixed with weight training.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.000
Well...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:03.540
The truth is, I wish I could always cheer him up like this,
but that can't always be the case so...

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:08.750
You know Natsuo, as your mom, I would be
so incredibly worried if you were always crying...

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.670
I'd feel like my heart would break.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.670
Now then, have you said a proper goodbye to Mom?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.420
Natsuo...

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:28.170
It's okay to cry today.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.920
Mom... would be sad...

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:40.830
It's okay, really... She'd forgive you, just for today...

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.880
Ten years, huh...?

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:52.390
Note: A Buddhist prayer for the dead.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:52.390
Namuamidabu

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:52.170
Honestly, I've gotten used to it, but I do wonder
how it would've been if she were still alive.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.460
If Mom was here...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.750
I wonder what she'd say to the present-day me now...

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.040
Huh? Why are you guys here?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:06.420
We got the location from Fujii-san and...

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:09.790
we hadn't done proper introductions
since we became family, so...

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:14.380
That reminds me. We went and bought
your mother's favorite thing as an offering.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.460
Chestnut monaka from Takanodo.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:24.670
Also, I already told Rui, but I have something I'd like
to report to you Natsuo-kun, and your mother.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.460
Huh?

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:30.210
I broke up with Shuu-san and can
openly have a clear conscience now.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.420
What?!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:36.540
Um, while I was the one to push for you
to break up and all... you sure?

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:37.790
Yeah...

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:43.080
He’d been talking about whether or not
he'd leave his wife for about half a year.

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:47.920
I'd been thinking that he might not have any intention
of doing so, but I just couldn't make up my mind.

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.130
He was my first love, so...

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:56.040
But, I realized that you guys are more important to me.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:58.130
I'm sorry for a lot of things...

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.460
You must be glad.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:02.330
Yeah.

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:07.880
Well then, let's make our formal introductions.
Rui, please place the flowers as an offering.

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:10.830
Ready?

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:11.880
Right.

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:15.130
We've become family with Natsuo-kun. I'm Hina.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.210
And I'm Rui.

00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:17.790
From here on...

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.000
Please watch over all of us.
please watch over all of us.

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:32.040
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:32.040
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.830
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:44.380
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:44.380
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:53.960
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:53.960
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:54.540 --> 00:23:02.840
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:54.540 --> 00:23:02.840
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:11.130
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:11.130
The easiest things become harder to do

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.090
Otona ni nareba

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.090
If I become an adult,

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:27.590
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:27.590
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.840
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.840
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:37.040
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:37.040
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:41.590
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:41.590
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:46.090
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:46.090
I can't stand it more

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:51.540
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:51.540
Don't look that way

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:57.910
Is It Okay...

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:57.910
If I Fall

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:57.910
For Him?

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:57.910
Episode 5

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:56.540
Is it okay... if I fall for him?
